# AutoML-Lens Environment Configuration
#
# The template the application actually reads lives in backend/:
#
#     backend/.env.example   ->   backend/.env
#
# backend/app/core/config.py sets ENV_FILE = backend/.env, so a .env placed at
# the repository root is NOT loaded. This file is kept only as a pointer so
# nobody edits the wrong copy. Run:  cd backend && cp .env.example .env
#
# Real environment variables (e.g. export GEMINI_API_KEY=...) are honoured too
# and take effect regardless of where .env lives.
